M1 - Week 2 (Graded) — Problem Definition
Goal: Commit to a domain, decision, and dataset plan with measurable success criteria.
Deliverables (submit in Canvas):
• Domain + stakeholder (1–2 sentences)
• Decision statement (one sentence)
• Dataset plan (link + 3 bullets: what/why/limitations)
• Success criteria (2–3 measurable bullets)
Checklist (before you submit):
• Decision statement includes who decides + what changes based on output.
