• You list at least 2 limitations/risks (bias, missingness, realism, etc.).
Category	Points	Meets Expectations	Exceeds Expectations
Decision clarity	30	Decision mostly clear.	Decision is crisp, action-oriented, includes stakeholder and context.
Dataset plan	30	Dataset identified, limited detail.	Strong justification; realistic plan; notes constraints/ethics if relevant.
Success criteria	20	Some criteria defined.	Measurable criteria tied to decision outcomes/costs.
Communication quality	20	Readable.	Professional and easy to scan; strong structure.
Helpful resources (credible):
• Kaggle datasets: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets

